**************************************************************************************************************************************
HOW TO CREATE TABLE WITH CONSTRAINS : 

CREATE TABLE person (
    id BIGSERIAL NOT NULL PRIMARY KEY,
    first_name VARCHAR(50) NOT NULL,
    last_name VARCHAR(50) NOT NULL,
    gender VARCHAR(7) NOT NULL,
    date_of_birth DATE NOT NULL,
    email VARCHAR(150)  // Because everyone don't have email
);

Nullable fields can be left empty (NULL), but NOT NULL fields are required and cannot be left blank.

